iew_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-07-26T15:04:11Z","label":{"name":"A-Window","color":"c6a751"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/886794044","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/2501#issuecomment-886794044","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/2501","id":886794044,"node_id":"IC_kwDODf6-U84022c8","user":{"login":"alice-i-cecile","id":3579909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Nzk5MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3579909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile","html_url":"https://github.com/alice-i-cecile","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-26T15:17:02Z","updated_at":"2021-07-26T15:17:02Z","body":"Doing a bit of digging, this issue seems like it might have promising breadcrumbs from winit, our upstream dependency for windowing: https://github.com/rust-windowing/winit/issues/1491\r\n\r\nNow, let's track how cursor position is set... \r\n\r\n[`update_cursor_position_from_backend`](https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/85ab55a05b3386275c9ff6c3cf34bbea0fc6b43d/crates/bevy_window/src/window.rs#L488\r\n) seems to be the function in question. Let's see where that's called: [here](https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/927973ce6aeab62e65fe8bf2584c4f26b8904df8/crates/bevy_winit/src/lib.rs#L315), in the `bevy_winit` module.\r\n\r\nWe have access to the scale factor information in that function already; it looks like it's just a matter of adding a multiplication step just above L315 (and adding some tests). ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/886794044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"alice-i-cecile","id":3579909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Nzk5MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3579909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile","html_url":"https://github.com/alice-i-cecile","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":5069096947,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDUwNjkwOTY5NDc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/events/5069096947","actor":{"login":"alice-i-cecile","id":3579909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1Nzk5MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3579909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","u